WorldInfo {
  info [
    "Assignment 3: one arena with red, green and blue blocks, a dog, a deer, a horse and a truck."
    "The e-puck reports colour blocks, classifies the animals with the CIFAR-10 CNN"
    "and saves a camera image of every detection in controllers/Assignment_3/captures."
  ]
}
